  {
   "id": "p8",
   "text": "We expected one thing to save us: surely a vision model doing the OCR would notice the injection and refuse. It did the opposite. Tesseract physically can't see white-on-white text or four-point type \u2014 the vision model reads all of it. It transmitted twice as many payloads. And in eighteen percent of documents, it executed the instruction while transcribing \u2014 we asked for a transcript and got a page of French.",
